OL,3,GNEWSAA66 fatal crash: Who has been
OL,4,Aarrested or charged?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMultiple people have been arrested and
OL,7,Fcharged in connection with a wrong-way
OL,8,Fcrash on the A66 which killed seven
OL,9,Fpeople, including two police officers.
OL,11,FA Volkswagen Passat with five young men
OL,12,Fhit an oncoming marked Cleveland Police
OL,13,Fvehicle on the dual-carriageway near
OL,14,FMiddlesbrough at about 03:39 BST on
OL,15,FSaturday 22 August.
OL,17,FOfficers PC Matthew Blades, 37, and PC
OL,18,FTom Clough, 38, died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
