OL,3,GNEWSAA66 fatal crash: Who has been
OL,4,Aarrested or charged?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe occupants of the VW Passat, which
OL,7,Fwas going the wrong way down the A66 at
OL,8,FSouth Bank - Michael Robert Cahill, 23,
OL,9,FJakub Matusiak, 23, Makai Saddington,
OL,10,F18, and 17-year-olds Theo Rae and Cole
OL,11,FRobert Worthy - also died.
